NTE*GEN*ONE LX LOOP PER RECORD. A KEY MAY APPEAR IN SEVERAL LOOPS; EACH LOOP STANDS ALONE~
NTE*GEN*A SEGMENT ABSENT FROM A LOOP MEANS THE VALUE WAS NOT REPORTED~
NTE*GEN*DTP FORMAT QUALIFIER D8 = DATE AS CCYYMMDD (FOUR-DIGIT YEAR, MONTH, DAY)~
NTE*GEN*AMT VALUES ARE US DOLLARS WITH EXPLICIT DECIMAL POINT~
NTE*GEN*TDS01 IS US DOLLARS WITH IMPLIED TWO DECIMAL PLACES (TDS*4400000 = 44000.00)~
